# Frontend build context exclusions.
#
# The context is `frontend/`. The duplicate `padhaanewala/bot_robot.glb`
# (1,001,448 bytes, byte-identical to `frontend/public/bot_robot.glb`) lives
# one directory *above* this context, so it is never sent to the daemon by this
# build. The duplicate is still worth deleting from the repository — see
# "Repository hygiene" in docs/Pending-phases.md — but it cannot bloat an image
# from here.

# --- The build output. Rebuilt inside the image. -----------------------
# Sending the host's `.next` is not merely wasteful: it was produced by a
# possibly different Next version on a different platform, and a stale
# `.next/cache` can make the in-image build reuse artefacts it should re-derive.
.next/
out/
build/
dist/

# --- Dependencies. 373 packages, ~500 MB, reinstalled in the image. ----
# Copying these in would install Windows-platform binaries into a Linux image
# (next-swc, lightningcss, sharp), producing a runtime that fails on the first
# request.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/

# --- Secrets ------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
secrets/

# --- Source that the runtime image does not need -------------------------
# `.agents/`, `.claude/` and `agent/` sit at the repository root, outside this
# context, so the duplicated agent-skill bundles (4.6 MB) are excluded by
# construction. `frontend/frontend/` is NOT excluded: it is the doubled path
# that tsconfig.json's `"@/*": ["./frontend/*", "./*"]` resolves ~200 component
# imports through. Removing it from the context would break the build.

# --- Tests / coverage --------------------------------------------------
coverage/
*.lcov

# --- Docs, editors, OS --------------------------------------------------
README.md
*.md
!AGENTS.md
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
